tisfies the case's &quot;6 distinct\n       Skills&quot; precondition.\n    2. Create an Agent.\n    3. Skills section starts at 0/5, add-skill control enabled.\n    4-8. Attach Skills 1-5 one at a time; counter increments &quot;N/5 skills\n       added.&quot; and a card renders after each attach.\n    9. Add-skill control becomes disabled the instant 5/5 is reached,\n       with an accessible tooltip — a 6th skill cannot be attached.\n    10. Confirm persistence via a full page reload (attach is\n       auto-saved via API; no explicit agent-level Save is available).\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"base_url","time":{"start":1787613942554,"stop":1787613942554,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"pytestconfig","time":{"start":1787613942554,"stop":1787613942554,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"delete_output_dir","time":{"start":1787613942554,"stop":1787613942554,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_verify_url","time":{"start":1787613942554,"stop":1787613942554,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"browser","time":{"start":1787613942554,"stop":1787613944835,"duration":2281},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":fal